Bottom line for this tool
Cheapest sensible setup: a single 24 GB GPU at 4-bit — L4 on GCP ($0.85/hr) or a 3090/4090 on Vast ($0.3–0.5/hr). Plenty for the agent/query loop.
Vast.ai is ~3–5× cheaper than GCP on-demand for the same VRAM; GCP wins on reliability, quotas, and if this becomes a persistent service.
Serve it with vLLM (--quantization awq, OpenAI-compatible) and point the tool at it: SYSTEMINTEL_AI_PROVIDER=vllm, SYSTEMINTEL_AI_BASE_URL=http://<host>:8000. My agent-loop fixes work unchanged.
